原文：
长城是世界上最伟大的建筑之一。它最初被修建用来抵御外敌。长城绵延数千公里。每年，大量游客来这里参观。长城已经成为中国的象征。

The Great Wall is the one of greatest buiding all over the the world. It used to be built for defencing the anemies. It streached over thousans kilos. Ever years,lots of 
trourist came to watch it. The Great Wall has been the symbol of China.


### 美化原句
The Great Wall is one of the greatest buildings in the world. It was originally built to defend against enemies.It stretches for thousands of kilometers. Every year,many 
tourists come to visit it. The Great Wall has become a symbol of China.


### 纠正错误
1. `the one of greatest buiding` → **one of the greatest buildings**；one of 后不加 the；building 拼写错误，one of + 复数名词
2. `used to be built` → **was built**；used to be 表示过去常常（现在不是），不符合句意
3. `for defencing the anemies` → **to defend against enemies**；defence 是名词，defend 动词；enemy 拼写错误，去掉多余 the
4. `streached over thousans kilos` → **stretches for thousands of kilometers**；stretch 拼写错误；thousands of 固定搭配；kilo 是公斤，千米是 kilometer
5. `Ever years` → **Every year**；Ever 错误
6. `trourist came` → **tourists come**；tourist 拼写错误；every year 是一般现在时，不用 came；watch 侧重看，参观景点用 visit
7. `has been the symbol` → **has become a symbol** 更贴合四级翻译语境


### 标准参照句
The Great Wall is one of the greatest structures in the world. It was constructed to defend against invaders. It stretches thousands of kilometers. Large numbers of 
tourists visit it annually. The Great Wall has become a symbol of China.
